    "detailed_description": "<strong>Blunatic</strong> is a grimdark dystopian visual novel. <br><br><strong>THE STORY</strong><br>You play Blunatic, a BLUE creature in underwear with a foul mouth that loves to go against the Establishment. <br><br>The Establishment is run by Kai Devilson of the Devilson clan. They're a bunch of brutal, brutal RED creatures who also wear underwear, who enslave all Blunatics. <br><br>Now, Kai Devilson really did a number on you. Could be NUMBER 1 or NUMBER 2. It's unclear.<br><br>What's clear is, Blunatic want REVENGE.<br><br><strong>THE GAME PLAY</strong><br>Play as the main character and take control of all the decision-making in the game.<br>Explore different branches of the story. Discover parts of the story that will blow your mind.<br>Make choices in this visual novel to get said REVENGE.<br>Curse, deceive, slaughter your enemies.<br><br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br>Simple point and click system.<br>Realistic bone animations and movements that bring characters to life.<br>Select choices to shape the outcome that you want.<br>Replay the game to explore different paths.<br><br><strong>CLOSING REMARKS</strong><br>Look, I'm not sure if you've even made it to this sentence. But, the scenes are BRUTAL. There will be BLOOD. Turn away if you can't take it. ",
